 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0030/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0030</a>|2026/07/24 04:49| 01 | 180| 066| 0294| 0194| 0204| 0738|    \n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/07/23 20:36| 02 | 021| 012| 0256| 0048| 0212| 0341|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/07/23 18:36| 03 | 015| 060| 0148| 0034| 0109| 0270|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/22 12:12| 02 | 301| 020| 0999| 0697| 0118| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/22 11:12| 01 | 319| 032| 0315| 0343| 0189| 1302|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/22 11:12| 04 | 017| 032| 030"
